    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Join the battle in an exciting arcade game where you take on the role
    of a brave defender, controlling a powerful gun. You will have to fight countless
    waves of enemies who are trying to destroy you.



    Every few waves, a powerful
    boss appears on the battlefield, becoming more difficult and dangerous with each
    appearance. Your main goal is to survive as long as possible, repelling enemy
    attacks and destroying them with the help of various types of guns.



    To
    increase your chances of survival, you will have to acquire new guns. Each gun
    has unique characteristics and damage multipliers, which allows you to more effectively
    cope with the advancing waves of enemies.'
